---
import GenericPageLayout from '../../layouts/GenericPageLayout.astro';
import styles from '../../styles/about.module.css';
---

<GenericPageLayout 
  title="Digital Institutional Repository" 
  subtitle="Archiving FUAZ's academic output and intellectual heritage."
  heroImage="/media/DSC_4908.webp"
  breadcrumbs={[
    { label: 'Library', href: '/library' },
    { label: 'Repository', href: '/library/repository' }
  ]}
>
  <div class={styles.contentWrapper}>
    <h2 class={styles.heading2}>Preserving Knowledge</h2>
    <p class={styles.paragraph}>
      The FUAZ Institutional Digital Repository (IDR) is an open-access digital archive designed to capture, preserve, and distribute the intellectual output of the university's researchers, faculties, and students. It serves as a permanent, searchable database for indigenous agricultural science.
    </p>

    <h2 class={styles.heading2}>Available Collections</h2>
    <ul class={styles.list}>
      <li><strong>Theses & Dissertations:</strong> Full-text PDFs of all approved M.Sc. and Ph.D. dissertations from 2020 to present.</li>
      <li><strong>Past Examination Papers:</strong> A secured archive of undergraduate examination papers for revision purposes (login required).</li>
      <li><strong>Inaugural Lectures:</strong> Transcripts and presentations from professorial inaugurations.</li>
      <li><strong>Journal of Agriculture:</strong> Pre-prints and published open-access articles from the university journal.</li>
    </ul>

    <div class={styles.importantBox}>
      <strong>Thesis Submission:</strong> All graduating students are required to submit a watermarked soft-copy of their approved final-year project to the Library IT Desk before clearance can be generated.
    </div>
  </div>
</GenericPageLayout>
